[00:00.00] 作词 : Blake Pendergrass
[00:00.00][by:土豆头_先生]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Blake Pendergrass
[00:12.47]I got a million questions, like, "Why the hell can't Heaven be on Earth?"
[00:12.47]我心里有无数个问题，比如“为什么天堂不能就在这人世间？”
[00:18.38]Why do good folks have to hurt?
[00:18.38]为什么好人也会受伤？
[00:23.02]Why's life a lesson?
[00:23.02]为什么人生非得是一堂课？
[00:24.97]Why's every single blessin' have a curse?
[00:24.97]为什么每一个祝福背后总藏着点诅咒？
[00:28.81]Why's love take so much work?
[00:28.81]为什么爱需要那么费心力去经营？
[00:32.94]And why does Mom and Daddy's hair have to turn gray?
[00:32.94]为什么爸妈的头发非得慢慢变白？
[00:37.87]I guess everyone's got reasons why their shoulders carry weight
[00:37.87]大概每个人心里都有些理由让肩膀承受这些重量吧
[00:43.83]There's been a few days I 'bout folded
[00:43.83]有些日子我差点就撑不住了
[00:46.68]But I found one more card to play
[00:46.68]但还是在牌堆里摸到了一张能继续玩的牌
[00:49.40]Been a few days, I was hopeless
[00:49.40]有些日子我真的快绝望
[00:51.92]And I'll be damned, I drew an ace
[00:51.92]可偏偏那天我抽到了一张A
[00:54.64]Guess that's life and that's why I remind myself
[00:54.64]大概人生就是这样所以我总提醒自己
[00:58.09]To spend more time talkin' to the dealer
[00:58.09]别总纠结手上拿到的牌
[01:01.59]Than worryin' about the hands I'm dealt
[01:01.59]不如多跟发牌的老天聊聊
[01:08.49]Sure feels like life would be better if hearts like mine, they never wound up broke
[01:08.49]有时候真觉得要是像我这样的人心永远不会破碎生活可能会轻松点
[01:15.69]That ain't how most stories go
[01:15.69]但故事从来不是那样发展的
[01:20.25]I won't lie, I'm tired of walkin' through this fire and brimstone world we all call home
[01:20.25]我不骗你我真的厌倦了走在这个像火与硫磺堆出来的世界大家还叫它家园
[01:30.20]But I'm, I'm still sittin' at the table makin' bets
[01:30.20]不过呢，我还是坐在这张桌边继续下注
[01:35.69]I'm bettin' that some better times are comin' up ahead, yeah
[01:35.69]赌未来还会有些好日子在前头等着
[01:41.23]There's been a few days I 'bout folded
[01:41.23]有些日子我差点就放弃了
[01:44.10]But I found one more card to play
[01:44.10]但还是找到了一张能继续撑下去的牌
[01:46.83]Been a few days, I was hopeless
[01:46.83]有些日子我真的什么希望都没了
[01:49.34]And I'll be damned, I drew an ace
[01:49.34]可偏偏那天我摸到了一张A
[01:51.92]I guess that's life and that's why I remind myself
[01:51.92]这大概就是人生所以我总提醒自己
[01:55.51]To spend more time talkin' to the dealer
[01:55.51]别太在意命运给你的牌
[01:59.01]Than worryin' about the hands I'm dealt
[01:59.01]多花点时间跟老天聊聊
[02:05.38]The hands I'm dealt
[02:05.38]那些我手上拿到的牌
[02:11.10]And I used to think you're supposed to pray
[02:11.10]以前我以为你应该祷告
[02:14.35]'Cause it was somethin' that God needs
[02:14.35]是因为上帝所需要
[02:17.28]But now I see it's less for him
[02:17.28]后来才明白这是对他而言的
